  m_Name: Cleric
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Key: Cleric
  Label: Cleric
  Blurb: Keeps everyone else standing, and is quietly dangerous to the wrong things.
  Vision:
    Fantasy: A devout healer. Will prioritise others over herself, with the strongest
      focus being on healing and support.
    Role: 'The strongest backline healer. Almost everything scales of spirit, perhaps
      a few offensive spells off int AND spirit. '
    SignatureMechanic: "Is the main source for reviving, although most likely not
      the only one. However, should be the only one with access to mass-revive. \t"
    UltraStyle: 
    Ultras: []
    Branches:
    - GridBranch: a
      Becomes: "A pure healer with ensuring others stay topped off. \t"
      IntendedKit: A direct heal => a magic shield => regen => Revive
      Summon: Phoenix, Mass revive and heal (both start out at low %)
    - GridBranch: b
      Becomes: A more supportive role with aim on tempo improvements
      IntendedKit: Endurance +x% to all => restore 1 ability charge for 1 hero =>
        ???
      Summon: '[name], Protective shield for X% of total health to all + endurance
        buff '
    - GridBranch: c
      Becomes: 'Holy damage dealer with extra damage to undead type of enemies '
      IntendedKit: Divine bolt => ???
      Summon: '[name], A replacement summon, oriented around holy damage'
    Overlaps: Paladin on healing
    OpenQuestions: 
